flowchart LR
 Qty[Haul Quantity] --> Payload[Effective Truck Payload]
 Payload --> Trips[Trips = ceil(Qty/Payload)]
 Load[Load Time] --> Cycle[Cycle Minutes]
 Out[Outbound Travel] --> Cycle
 Dump[Dump/Queue] --> Cycle
 Return[Return Travel] --> Cycle
 Delay[Configured Delays] --> Cycle
 Cycle --> Count[Truck Count to Balance Production]
 Trips --> Cost[Trip/Hour Haul Cost]
 Count --> Cost
